<style>
/* ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   CONTACT PAGE — Premium SaaS Redesign
   ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */

/* Reset body for this page */
body.contact-layout-body { background: #070B14 !important; color: #fff; overflow-x: hidden; margin: 0; }

.cp-home-link {
  position: fixed;
  top: 20px;
  left: 24px;
  z-index: 10;
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
  padding: 10px 16px;
  border-radius: 10px;
  background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  color: #CBD5E1;
  font-size: 0.85rem;
  font-weight: 500;
  text-decoration: none;
  backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
  transition: color 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
}
.cp-home-link:hover {
  color: #fff;
  border-color: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.45);
  transform: translateY(-1px);
  text-decoration: none;
}

/* ── CSS variables ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.cp-page {
  --cp-bg0:        #070B14;
  --cp-bg1:        #0F172A;
  --cp-accent-1:   #6366F1;
  --cp-accent-2:   #8B5CF6;
  --cp-accent-3:   #EC4899;
  --cp-text:       #FFFFFF;
  --cp-text-2:     #CBD5E1;
  --cp-text-3:     #94A3B8;
  --cp-card:       rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.7);
  --cp-border:     rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07);
  --cp-radius:     18px;
  --cp-radius-sm:  12px;
  --cp-blur:       blur(16px);
  --cp-shadow:     0 24px 64px rgba(0,0,0,0.55);
}

/* ── Page wrapper ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.cp-page {
  position: relative;
  min-height: 100vh;
  padding: 80px 24px 100px;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  overflow: hidden;
}

/* ── Animated background ───────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.cp-bg {
  position: fixed;
  inset: 0;
  z-index: 0;
  pointer-events: none;
  overflow: hidden;
}

/* Radial glow blobs */
.cp-glow {
  position: absolute;
  border-radius: 50%;
  filter: blur(100px);
  opacity: 0.3;
  animation: cp-float linear infinite;
}
.cp-glow--1 {
  width: 600px; height: 600px;
  background: radial-gradient(circle, #6366F1 0%, transparent 70%);
  top: -200px; left: -150px;
  animation-duration: 18s;
}
.cp-glow--2 {
  width: 500px; height: 500px;
  background: radial-gradient(circle, #EC4899 0%, transparent 70%);
  bottom: -100px; right: -100px;
  animation-duration: 22s;
  animation-direction: reverse;
}
.cp-glow--3 {
  width: 400px; height: 400px;
  background: radial-gradient(circle, #8B5CF6 0%, transparent 70%);
  top: 40%; left: 45%;
  animation-duration: 26s;
}

@keyframes cp-float {
  0%, 100% { transform: translate(0, 0) scale(1); }
  33%       { transform: translate(40px, -30px) scale(1.06); }
  66%       { transform: translate(-30px, 20px) scale(0.96); }
}

/* Dot grid overlay */
.cp-grid {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  background-image:
    radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,255,255,0.08) 1px, transparent 1px);
  background-size: 32px 32px;
  mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 80% at 50% 50%, black 40%, transparent 100%);
  -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 80% at 50% 50%, black 40%, transparent 100%);
}

/* Floating particles */
.cp-particle {
  position: absolute;
  width: 2px; height: 2px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.7);
  animation: cp-rise linear infinite;
}
@keyframes cp-rise {
  0%   { transform: translateY(0) translateX(0); opacity: 0; }
  10%  { opacity: 1; }
  90%  { opacity: 0.6; }
  100% { transform: translateY(-80vh) translateX(20px); opacity: 0; }
}

/* ── Content ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.cp-content {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 1240px;
}

/* ── Top badge + heading ───────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.cp-hero {
  text-align: center;
  margin-bottom: 72px;
  animation: cp-fadein 0.7s ease both;
}

@keyframes cp-fadein {
  from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); }
  to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
}

.cp-badge {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
  background: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.12);
  border: 1px solid rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.3);
  color: #a5b4fc;
  font-size: 0.78rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  padding: 7px 16px;
  border-radius: 999px;
  margin-bottom: 24px;
}
.cp-badge::before {
  content: '';
  width: 7px; height: 7px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: #22c55e;
  animation: cp-ping 2s ease infinite;
}
@keyframes cp-ping {
  0%, 100% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(34,197,94,0.6); }
  50%       { box-shadow: 0 0 0 5px rgba(34,197,94,0); }
}

.cp-hero__title {
  font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.2rem);
  font-weight: 800;
  line-height: 1.15;
  margin: 0 auto 18px;
  max-width: 760px;
  letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff 0%, #CBD5E1 50%, #94A3B8 100%);
  -webkit-background-clip: text;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  background-clip: text;
}
.cp-hero__title span {
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, #6366F1, #8B5CF6, #EC4899);
  -webkit-background-clip: text;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  background-clip: text;
}

.cp-hero__sub {
  font-size: 1rem;
  color: var(--cp-text-3);
  max-width: 560px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  line-height: 1.7;
}

/* ── Two-column grid ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.cp-grid-2col {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.5fr;
  gap: 32px;
  align-items: start;
  animation: cp-fadein 0.9s 0.15s ease both;
}

/* ── Left panel ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.cp-left {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 20px;
}

.cp-left__intro {
  background: var(--cp-card);
  border: 1px solid var(--cp-border);
  border-radius: var(--cp-radius);
  padding: 28px;
  backdrop-filter: var(--cp-blur);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: var(--cp-blur);
}

.cp-left__name {
  font-size: 1.35rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: #fff;
  margin: 0 0 6px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 10px;
}

.cp-avail-badge {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 5px;
  font-size: 0.68rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  background: rgba(34,197,94,0.12);
  border: 1px solid rgba(34,197,94,0.3);
  color: #4ade80;
  padding: 3px 10px;
  border-radius: 999px;
  letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}
.cp-avail-badge::before {
  content: '';
  width: 6px; height: 6px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: #22c55e;
}

.cp-left__bio {
  font-size: 0.875rem;
  color: var(--cp-text-3);
  line-height: 1.7;
  margin: 0;
}

/* Info cards */
.cp-info-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 12px;
}

.cp-info-card {
  background: var(--cp-card);
  border: 1px solid var(--cp-border);
  border-radius: var(--cp-radius-sm);
  padding: 16px;
  backdrop-filter: var(--cp-blur);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: var(--cp-blur);
  transition: border-color 0.25s ease, transform 0.25s ease, box-shadow 0.25s ease;
  cursor: default;
}

.cp-info-card:hover {
  border-color: rgba(99,102,241,0.4);
  transform: translateY(-2px);
  box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(99,102,241,0.12);
}

.cp-info-card__icon {
  width: 36px; height: 36px;
  border-radius: 9px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  font-size: 0.9rem;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}

.cp-info-card--indigo .cp-info-card__icon { background: rgba(99,102,241,0.15); color: #818cf8; }
.cp-info-card--violet .cp-info-card__icon { background: rgba(139,92,246,0.15); color: #a78bfa; }
.cp-info-card--pink   .cp-info-card__icon { background: rgba(236,72,153,0.15); color: #f472b6; }
.cp-info-card--cyan   .cp-info-card__icon { background: rgba(6,182,212,0.15);  color: #22d3ee; }
.cp-info-card--green  .cp-info-card__icon { background: rgba(34,197,94,0.15);  color: #4ade80; }
.cp-info-card--amber  .cp-info-card__icon { background: rgba(245,158,11,0.15); color: #fbbf24; }

.cp-info-card__label {
  font-size: 0.68rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.07em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--cp-text-3);
  margin-bottom: 3px;
}

.cp-info-card__value {
  font-size: 0.82rem;
  font-weight: 500;
  color: var(--cp-text-2);
  word-break: break-all;
}

/* Social links */
.cp-socials {
  background: var(--cp-card);
  border: 1px solid var(--cp-border);
  border-radius: var(--cp-radius-sm);
  padding: 18px 20px;
  backdrop-filter: var(--cp-blur);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: var(--cp-blur);
}

.cp-socials__label {
  font-size: 0.7rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--cp-text-3);
  margin-bottom: 14px;
}

.cp-socials__links {
  display: flex;
  gap: 10px;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}

.cp-social-btn {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
  padding: 9px 16px;
  border-radius: 10px;
  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
  color: var(--cp-text-2);
  font-size: 0.8rem;
  font-weight: 500;
  text-decoration: none;
  transition: all 0.2s ease;
}
.cp-social-btn:hover {
  color: #fff;
  background: rgba(99,102,241,0.15);
  border-color: rgba(99,102,241,0.4);
  transform: translateY(-1px);
  text-decoration: none;
}
.cp-social-btn i { font-size: 1rem; }

/* ── Right panel — Form ────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.cp-form-card {
  background: var(--cp-card);
  border: 1px solid var(--cp-border);
  border-radius: var(--cp-radius);
  padding: 44px 40px;
  backdrop-filter: var(--cp-blur);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: var(--cp-blur);
  box-shadow: var(--cp-shadow);
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
}

/* Subtle inner glow on the card */
.cp-form-card::before {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
  height: 1px;
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(99,102,241,0.5), rgba(236,72,153,0.4), transparent);
}

.cp-form-card__title {
  font-size: 1.5rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: #fff;
  margin: 0 0 6px;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
}

.cp-form-card__sub {
  font-size: 0.875rem;
  color: var(--cp-text-3);
  margin: 0 0 36px;
}

/* Row */
.cp-form-row {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 20px;
}

/* Floating label field */
.cp-field {
  position: relative;
  margin-bottom: 24px;
}

.cp-field label {
  position: absolute;
  left: 16px;
  top: 50%;
  transform: translateY(-50%);
  font-size: 0.9rem;
  color: var(--cp-text-3);
  pointer-events: none;
  transition: all 0.22s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1);
  background: transparent;
  padding: 0 4px;
  z-index: 1;
}

.cp-field--textarea label {
  top: 20px;
  transform: none;
}

/* Float state — triggered via .is-active class by JS */
.cp-field.is-active label,
.cp-field.has-value label {
  top: -1px;
  transform: translateY(-50%);
  font-size: 0.72rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  color: #818cf8;
  background: #0d1426;
  padding: 0 6px;
}

.cp-field--textarea.is-active label,
.cp-field--textarea.has-value label {
  top: -1px;
  transform: translateY(-50%);
}

.cp-field input,
.cp-field textarea,
.cp-field select {
  width: 100%;
  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
  border: 1.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
  border-radius: 12px;
  padding: 18px 16px 10px;
  font-size: 0.9rem;
  color: #fff;
  font-family: inherit;
  outline: none;
  transition: border-color 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease, background 0.2s ease;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  -webkit-appearance: none;
  caret-color: #818cf8;
}

.cp-field input:focus,
.cp-field textarea:focus,
.cp-field select:focus {
  border-color: rgba(99,102,241,0.7);
  background: rgba(99,102,241,0.05);
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(99,102,241,0.12), 0 0 20px rgba(99,102,241,0.08);
}

.cp-field textarea {
  resize: vertical;
  min-height: 140px;
  line-height: 1.6;
  padding-top: 22px;
}

/* Validation */
.cp-field.is-error input,
.cp-field.is-error textarea {
  border-color: rgba(239,68,68,0.7);
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(239,68,68,0.1);
}

.cp-field.is-error label { color: #f87171; }

.cp-field__err {
  display: none;
  font-size: 0.72rem;
  color: #f87171;
  margin-top: 5px;
  padding-left: 4px;
}
.cp-field.is-error .cp-field__err { display: block; }

/* Character count for textarea */
.cp-field__count {
  position: absolute;
  bottom: 10px;
  right: 12px;
  font-size: 0.65rem;
  color: var(--cp-text-3);
  pointer-events: none;
}

/* Submit button */
.cp-submit {
  position: relative;
  width: 100%;
  padding: 16px 24px;
  border: none;
  border-radius: 12px;
  font-size: 0.95rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  font-family: inherit;
  cursor: pointer;
  overflow: hidden;
  letter-spacing: 0.01em;
  transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6366F1 0%, #8B5CF6 50%, #EC4899 100%);
  color: #fff;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 10px;
  margin-top: 8px;
}

.cp-submit::before {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #818CF8, #A78BFA, #F472B6);
  opacity: 0;
  transition: opacity 0.25s ease;
}

.cp-submit:hover {
  transform: translateY(-2px);
  box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(99,102,241,0.4), 0 4px 16px rgba(236,72,153,0.25);
}
.cp-submit:hover::before { opacity: 1; }
.cp-submit:active { transform: translateY(0); }

.cp-submit__text,
.cp-submit__arrow,
.cp-submit__spinner {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
}

.cp-submit__spinner { display: none; }
.cp-submit__spinner svg {
  width: 18px; height: 18px;
  animation: cp-spin 0.8s linear infinite;
}
@keyframes cp-spin { to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }

.cp-submit--loading .cp-submit__text { opacity: 0.6; }
.cp-submit--loading .cp-submit__arrow { display: none; }
.cp-submit--loading .cp-submit__spinner { display: flex; }

/* Shimmer on the button */
.cp-submit::after {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  top: 0; left: -100%;
  width: 60%; height: 100%;
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(255,255,255,0.2), transparent);
  transform: skewX(-20deg);
  transition: left 0.5s ease;
}
.cp-submit:hover::after { left: 140%; }

/* ── Success overlay ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.cp-success {
  display: none;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  text-align: center;
  padding: 40px 20px;
  gap: 16px;
}

.cp-success.is-visible { display: flex; }
.cp-form-inner.is-hidden { display: none; }

.cp-success__icon {
  width: 72px; height: 72px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: rgba(34,197,94,0.15);
  border: 2px solid rgba(34,197,94,0.35);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  font-size: 1.8rem;
  color: #4ade80;
  animation: cp-popin 0.5s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1) both;
}
@keyframes cp-popin {
  from { transform: scale(0.4); opacity: 0; }
  to   { transform: scale(1);   opacity: 1; }
}

.cp-success__title {
  font-size: 1.35rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: #fff;
  margin: 0;
}

.cp-success__body {
  font-size: 0.875rem;
  color: var(--cp-text-3);
  line-height: 1.65;
  margin: 0;
  max-width: 360px;
}

.cp-success__btn {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
  padding: 12px 24px;
  border-radius: 10px;
  background: rgba(99,102,241,0.15);
  border: 1px solid rgba(99,102,241,0.35);
  color: #a5b4fc;
  font-size: 0.875rem;
  font-weight: 500;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: all 0.2s ease;
  text-decoration: none;
}
.cp-success__btn:hover {
  background: rgba(99,102,241,0.25);
  border-color: rgba(99,102,241,0.6);
  color: #c7d2fe;
  text-decoration: none;
}

/* ── Page entry animation ───────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.cp-reveal {
  animation: cp-fadein 0.7s ease both;
}
.cp-reveal--delay-1 { animation-delay: 0.1s; }
.cp-reveal--delay-2 { animation-delay: 0.2s; }
.cp-reveal--delay-3 { animation-delay: 0.3s; }
.cp-reveal--delay-4 { animation-delay: 0.4s; }

/* ── Mobile responsive ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
@media (max-width: 900px) {
  .cp-grid-2col { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .cp-form-card { padding: 32px 24px; }
  .cp-hero { margin-bottom: 48px; }
}

@media (max-width: 580px) {
  .cp-page { padding: 40px 16px 60px; }
  .cp-info-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
  .cp-form-row  { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .cp-hero__title { font-size: 1.8rem; }
  .cp-form-card { padding: 28px 18px; }
}
</style>

